{"type":"message","id":"e4761e81","parentId":"9e94f66a","timestamp":"2026-03-18T14:31:58.650Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Focusing on clarity**\n\nI need to create a concise summary, making sure to emphasize the preliminary findings rather than presenting any kind of diagnosis. It’s essential to communicate effectively while ensuring that the user understands this distinction. I want to keep things straightforward and clear, avoiding any potential confusion that could arise if I mix up preliminary details with a final diagnosis. Let’s make sure the summary addresses this appropriately!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b56f0a234d7ffb30169bab75567108191ac0445872ddb10b7\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpurdXxIiAw_hKwxHYpyvsOhfN92296gl5xKCTwZzywD5De7DkTJMQQc9ai0003DlNZOZih9q0xIWcuqa_cscKpQXk-dcuvm_thpJiA38jGCNBkwlWBMXg3rPmS-C2USySoraLMR7mULXSpKkCPlzFazFGYx7K_ejQW8nbjmKaW936LKqM5pyfp6KbYN85YqYtSqMuTb5MqjReyhvu5sVdVK2IlpY6yCzYMqh2gJXNJ9T1B3_rPO5eZAbcx-aEZqZE9NlD-5428oqnfYL29KIeRcPTbm7LG9iRznc3YfZUV_a2C0icpHdCGkx_5bJej92B1-pwGo5HXXeLR2vmTRguzVvNC1vsc5-am9OTUB23uVw1OJjiBCpAwWda9DmGfVslyoRjm4czMeK64XIThH6VM_fUMMioZBkMeHlytvG86RHb7LypfkSxYoDot0yDt_5qdx4BOpqNtV0nIS0PSDNE3huuAFj82t4JYrVyD1-Dae7KbvX2AIw-RmqCyNbyRTjqxY-8T1_lXbvAhoQjBNKjiRvWl69e51OFsSScrej6YPrTVF6CIiuP5voJo--BfTqFGJCuLIogvKBphf8ySn5zDl19eXuJTGllOIwb7vgjS48Uk_JdXOU7PTjmk0MTRyCVGFibUUo0xTeCn979ddRY-hbBjHTF0n1oqdfN3lQguJfHyaKJF2got7Y6MM4qE4cg7einl_4in2fykVVpkyAexN2nsSe-aawYqoqCjJODwQQpME6d8Z1HDyPXvvBnRnyKwY1rnTh9LAP_4skhTdvA50CWM51gQhrzO9VlhFs9asDHbJfZduEtSDbNNakmlU2lNZk1BxVzYdV8sUozb2RgSyqltHz2XaIXoGOWzr0r9v4Ghp2ROk2kSivxEctu2JZiwBjr\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Focusing on clarity**\\n\\nI need to create a concise summary, making sure to emphasize the preliminary findings rather than presenting any kind of diagnosis. It’s essential to communicate effectively while ensuring that the user understands this distinction. I want to keep things straightforward and clear, avoiding any potential confusion that could arise if I mix up preliminary details with a final diagnosis. Let’s make sure the summary addresses this appropriately!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] The pipeline completed on your CT scan.\n\n**Kidney Cancer Detector module**\n- Kidney cancer class: **kidney_tumor**\n- Confidence: **99.9979%**\n- Inference time: **3.27 s**\n\n**Image Analyzer module**\n- Image Analyzer prediction: **kidney_tumor**\n- CAM metrics:\n  - CAM coverage: **0.0128**\n  - CAM center ratio: **0.8250**\n  - CAM left-right asymmetry: **0.1000**\n  - CAM top-bottom asymmetry: **1.0000**\n- CAM explanation: the model focused on a **localized, central renal region with asymmetric distribution**, which the pipeline describes as visually consistent with a **localized structural alteration**\n\n**X-AI module**\n- Confidence interpretation: **very high confidence**, but the pipeline explicitly says this is **not a definitive diagnostic tool**\n- Summary: the pipeline reports a **high likelihood of kidney cancer** with visual evidence suggestive of a **kidney tumor**\n- Visual evidence: **detected a kidney tumor**\n- Recommended next steps:\n  1. Further medical evaluation with imaging/labs\n  2. Discuss the result with a medical professional\n  3. Consider additional diagnostic testing such as **biopsy or genetic testing**\n\n**References returned by the pipeline**\n- *Kidney Cancer: Diagnosis and Treatment* — American Cancer Society (2022)\n- *Imaging in Kidney Cancer* — European Association of Urology (2020)\n\nImportant: this is a **preliminary signal from a prototype pipeline, not an actual diagnosis**. If you want, I can now give you either:\n- a **plain-English interpretation** of these results, or\n- the **raw technical response** from the pipeline.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b56f0a234d7ffb30169bab7574e5c819187293060cae1b4d3\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"ope